        <activityName xml:lang="en">Furnace, pellets, 300kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Furnace, pellets, 300kW
Inventory refers to the production of a pellets furnace 15kW. Composition of the previous inventory was used and updated with the average weight of current pellet furnaces available in Switzerland.\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Holzenergie\nLocal subcategory: Heizungssysteme\nUVEK 2022 source file:EcoSpold_furnace_wood pellets_15-300kW_v0.2.xml\n\n
UUID: 09fc7b9c-3c5d-325e-bf0d-a47a9ad132a9
Includes materials, transports and energy used for the fabrication of the furnace, the chimney, the storage silo, the automatic fuel supply and the automatic control technique.
Location: undefined
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_09fc7b9c-3c5d-325e-bf0d-a47a9ad132a9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
